graph TD
    %% Inputs and Environmental Signals
    A[High Glucose Concentration] --> B[Glucose Import Signal]
    C[Low Oxygen Availability] --> D[Anaerobic Condition Signal]
    E[High Glucose Even with O2] --> F[Crabtree Effect Signal]
    
    B --> G{OR: Fermentation<br/>Trigger?}
    D --> G
    F --> G
    
    G -->|Yes| H[Activate Fermentation Pathway]
    G -->|No| I[Favor Respiration]
    
    %% Glucose Transport
    H --> J[Glucose Transporters HXT1-7]
    J --> K[Glucose Entry into Cytoplasm]
    K --> L[Intracellular Glucose]
    
    %% Glycolysis Phase 1: Energy Investment
    L --> M[Hexokinase HXK1/HXK2]
    M --> N[Glucose-6-Phosphate]
    N --> O[Phosphoglucose Isomerase PGI1]
    O --> P[Fructose-6-Phosphate]
    P --> Q[Phosphofructokinase PFK1/PFK2]
    Q --> R[Fructose-1,6-Bisphosphate]
    
    %% Glycolysis Phase 2: Cleavage
    R --> S[Aldolase FBA1]
    S --> T[Dihydroxyacetone Phosphate DHAP]
    S --> U[Glyceraldehyde-3-Phosphate G3P]
    T --> V[Triose Phosphate Isomerase TPI1]
    V --> U
    
    %% Glycolysis Phase 3: Energy Payoff
    U --> W[Glyceraldehyde-3-P Dehydrogenase TDH1-3]
    W --> X[1,3-Bisphosphoglycerate]
    X --> Y[Phosphoglycerate Kinase PGK1]
    Y --> Z[3-Phosphoglycerate + ATP]
    
    Z --> AA[Phosphoglycerate Mutase GPM1-3]
    AA --> AB[2-Phosphoglycerate]
    AB --> AC[Enolase ENO1/ENO2]
    AC --> AD[Phosphoenolpyruvate PEP]
    AD --> AE[Pyruvate Kinase CDC19/PYK2]
    AE --> AF[Pyruvate + ATP]
    
    %% Regulatory Decision Point
    AF --> AG{OR: Oxygen Available<br/>for Respiration?}
    D --> AG
    
    AG -->|No O2| AH[Commit to Fermentation]
    AG -->|O2 Present but<br/>High Glucose| AH
    AG -->|O2 + Low Glucose| AI[Pyruvate to Mitochondria]
    
    %% Fermentation Branch
    AH --> AJ[Pyruvate Decarboxylase PDC1/PDC5/PDC6]
    AJ --> AK[Acetaldehyde + CO2]
    
    %% NAD+ Regeneration Critical Step
    AK --> AL{AND: Acetaldehyde +<br/>NADH Available?}
    W --> AM[NADH Production from Glycolysis]
    AM --> AL
    
    AL -->|Yes| AN[Alcohol Dehydrogenase ADH1/ADH2]
    AN --> AO(\1)
    AN --> AP[NAD+ Regenerated]
    
    %% NAD+ Recycling Loop
    AP --> AQ[NAD+ Returns to Glycolysis]
    AQ --> W
    
    %% ATP Balance and Energy
    Z --> AR[Net ATP Production]
    AE --> AR
    M --> AS[ATP Consumed in Early Glycolysis]
    Q --> AS
    
    AR --> AT{Is ATP Sufficient<br/>for Growth?}
    AT -->|Yes| AU[Maintain Fermentation Rate]
    AT -->|No| AV[Increase Glucose Uptake]
    AV --> J
    
    %% Byproducts and Alternatives
    AF --> AW{OR: Alternative<br/>Pyruvate Fate?}
    AW -->|Minor| AX[Pyruvate Dehydrogenase Bypass]
    AW -->|Minor| AY[Amino Acid Biosynthesis]
    AW -->|Major| AJ
    
    %% Regulation by Glucose Sensing
    B --> AZ[/SNF1/Snf1 Kinase Inhibition/]
    AZ --> BA[/Glucose Repression Active/]
    BA --> BB[/Repress Respiratory Genes/]
    BA --> BC[Activate Fermentation Genes]
    BC --> J
    BC --> M
    BC --> AJ
    BC --> AN
    
    %% Output and Products
    AO --> BD[Ethanol Accumulation]
    AK --> BE[CO2 Release]
    BD --> BF{Ethanol Concentration<br/>Toxic?}
    BF -->|High| BG[Ethanol Stress Response]
    BF -->|Normal| BH[Continue Fermentation]
    
    BG --> BI[Hsp12, Hsp26 Induction]
    BG --> BJ[Reduced Fermentation Rate]
    
    %% Glycerol Production (Redox Balance Alternative)
    T --> BK{OR: Excess NADH?}
    BK -->|Yes| BL[Glycerol-3-P Dehydrogenase GPD1/GPD2]
    BL --> BM[Glycerol Production]
    BM --> BN[NAD+ Regenerated]
    BN --> AQ
    
    %% Final Products
    BD --> BO[Ethanol Export]
    BE --> BP[CO2 Released as Gas]
    BM --> BQ[Glycerol as Byproduct]
    AR --> BR[ATP for Cellular Processes]
    
    %% Oxygen Shift Response
    C --> BS{Oxygen Returns?}
    BS -->|Yes| BT[Diauxic Shift]
    BT --> BU[Activate Respiratory Genes]
    BT --> BV[Ethanol Consumption]
    BV --> BW[Acetyl-CoA via Acetaldehyde]
    BW --> AI
    
